msgstr "確認"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:156
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:226
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:260
msgid "Couldn't reach DUPR. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "無法連線至 DUPR，請稍後再試。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:474
msgid "Create one at mydupr.com or in the DUPR app"
msgstr "可至 mydupr.com 或 DUPR App 建立帳號"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:443
msgid "Disconnect DUPR"
msgstr "解除連結 DUPR"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:494
msgid "Disconnect DUPR?"
msgstr "要解除連結 DUPR 嗎？"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:471
msgid "Don't have a DUPR account?"
msgstr "還沒有 DUPR 帳號？"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:55
msgid "doubles"
msgstr "雙打"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:423
msgid "DUPR"
msgstr "DUPR"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:318
msgid "DUPR ID"
msgstr "DUPR ID"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:152
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:486
msgid "DUPR linking isn't available right now."
msgstr "目前無法連結 DUPR。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:389
msgid "DUPR login"
msgstr "DUPR 登入"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:187
msgid "DUPR sent something we couldn't read. Please try again."
msgstr "DUPR 回傳的資料無法解讀，請再試一次。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:297
msgid "Last synced"
msgstr "上次同步"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:331
msgid ""
"Link your DUPR account to use your verified DUPR rating here. While it's "
"linked, it replaces your self-rating."
msgstr ""
"連結你的 DUPR 帳號，即可在此使用已驗證的 DUPR 評分。連結期間將取代你的自評分"
"數。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:266
msgid "Linked"
msgstr "已連結"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:271
msgid "Linking"
msgstr "連結中"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:360
msgid "Linking your account…"
msgstr "正在連結你的帳號…"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:384
msgid "Loading DUPR…"
msgstr "正在載入 DUPR…"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:375
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:457
msgid "Log in with DUPR"
msgstr "使用 DUPR 登入"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:274
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:278
msgid "Not linked"
msgstr "未連結"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:26
msgid "NR"
msgstr "NR"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:37
msgid "provisional"
msgstr "暫定"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:378
msgid ""
"Sign in to DUPR to link your account. We store your DUPR ID and ratings — "
"never your DUPR password."
msgstr ""
"登入 DUPR 以連結帳號。我們只會儲存你的 DUPR ID 與評分，絕不會儲存你的 DUPR 密"
"碼。"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:69
msgid "singles"
msgstr "單打"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:150
msgid "That DUPR account is already linked to another player."
msgstr "該 DUPR 帳號已連結至其他球員。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:154
msgid "That DUPR sign-in has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "此 DUPR 登入已逾期，請再試一次。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:495
msgid ""
"Your DUPR rating will stop being used here and your self-rating picker comes "
"back."
msgstr "此處將不再使用你的 DUPR 評分，並恢復自評分數選擇。"
